{"id":"wb-7-382","name":"水口山铅锌矿冶遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"水口山铅锌矿冶遗址","text":"水口山铅锌矿冶遗址位于湖南省常宁市松柏镇和水口山街道，总分布范围达120公顷。遗址包括19处地面遗迹和地下遗迹，反映了水口山铅锌矿的发展历史。水口山铅锌矿冶遗址于2011年入选第七批全国重点文物保护单位。2018年被列入中国科协创新战略研究院和中国城市学会联合发布的第一批中国工业遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E5%8F%A3%E5%B1%B1%E9%93%85%E9%94%8C%E7%9F%BF%E5%86%B6%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86555136,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555136","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fbf01ff62552e1b2575acf8e.jpg","title":"Factory_of_Lead-zinc_mine,_Hunan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Factory_of_Lead-zinc_mine,_Hunan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/Factory_of_Lead-zinc_mine%2C_Hunan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Allervous","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"中国常寧市の水口山の鉛および亜鉛の鉱山","width":320,"height":213}}